.TH "mdcat" "1" "2026\-10\-10" "TheCRatTime"
.SH NAME
\fBmdcat\fR \- print Markdown to terminal.\&
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBmdcat \fIFILE\fR
.fi
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is a small render for Markdown markup.\& Uses
escape\-codes to make text \fBbold\fR, \fIitalic\fR and
reverse.\&
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcat\fR(1)
